#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:630
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_TinyIslandCommunity"
msgid ""
"DEWFORD is a tiny island community.\n"
"If something gets trendy here,\l"
"everyone picks up on it right away.$"
msgstr ""
"武斗镇是个小小的海岛社区。\n"
"这里只要流行起什么东西，\l"
"大家马上就会跟着学。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:635
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_TownSign"
msgid ""
"DEWFORD TOWN\n"
"“A tiny island in the blue sea.”$"
msgstr ""
"武斗镇\n"
"“蔚蓝大海中的小岛”$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:639
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_GymSign"
msgid ""
"DEWFORD TOWN POKéMON GYM\n"
"LEADER: BRAWLY\l"
"“A big wave in fighting!”$"
msgstr ""
"武斗镇宝可梦道馆\n"
"馆主：藤树\l"
"“格斗界的大浪！”$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:644
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_HallSign"
msgid ""
"DEWFORD HALL\n"
"“Everyone's information exchange!”$"
msgstr ""
"武斗会馆\n"
"“大家的信息交流站！”$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:648
msgctxt "Route104_Text_LandedInDewfordDeliverLetter"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Ahoy!\n"
"We've hit land in DEWFORD.\p"
"I suppose you're off to deliver that\n"
"LETTER to, who was it now, STEVEN!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：喂！\n"
"我们到武斗镇了。\p"
"你是要去送信吧？\n"
"收信人是谁来着？对了，是大吾！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:654
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_SetSailBackToPetalburg"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Have you delivered your\n"
"LETTER?\p"
"Or were you meaning to sail back to\n"
"PETALBURG?$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：你的信送到了吗？\p"
"还是说你想坐船\n"
"回橙华市？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:660
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_PetalburgWereSettingSail2"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: PETALBURG it is, then!\p"
"Anchors aweigh!\n"
"PEEKO, we're setting sail, my darling!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：那就去橙华市吧！\p"
"起锚！\n"
"皮可，我们要出航了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:665
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_GoDeliverIllBeWaiting"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Then you go on and deliver\n"
"the LETTER. I'll be waiting.$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：那你就去送信吧。\n"
"我在这里等你。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:669
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_BrineyLandedInDewford"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Ahoy!\n"
"We've hit land in DEWFORD!\p"
"You just go on and tell me whenever\n"
"you want to set sail again!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：喂！\n"
"我们到武斗镇了！\p"
"想再出航的时候，\n"
"随时告诉我就行了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:675
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_WhereAreWeBound"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Ahoy!\n"
"For you, I'll go out to sea anytime!\p"
"Now, my friend, where are we bound?$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：喂！\n"
"为了你，我随时都可以出海！\p"
"那么，朋友，我们要去哪里？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:680
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_PetalburgWereSettingSail"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: PETALBURG, is it?\p"
"Anchors aweigh!\n"
"PEEKO, we're setting sail, my darling!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：去橙华市是吧？\p"
"起锚！\n"
"皮可，我们要出航了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:685
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_SlateportWereSettingSail"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: SLATEPORT, is it?\p"
"Anchors aweigh!\n"
"PEEKO, we're setting sail, my darling!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：去凯那市是吧？\p"
"起锚！\n"
"皮可，我们要出航了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:690
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_JustTellMeWhenYouNeedToSetSail"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: You just tell me whenever\n"
"you need to set sail again!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：想再出航的时候，\n"
"随时告诉我就行了！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:694
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_GettingItchToFish"
msgid ""
"This is a renowned fishing spot.\n"
"Are you getting the itch to fish?$"
msgstr ""
"这里是有名的钓鱼胜地。\n"
"你是不是也手痒想钓鱼了？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:698
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_GiveYouOneOfMyRods"
msgid ""
"I hear you, and I like what\n"
"you're saying!\p"
"I'll give you one of my fishing RODS.$"
msgstr ""
"你说得好，我喜欢！\p"
"我送你一根我的钓竿吧。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:703
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_ThrowInFishingAdvice"
msgid ""
"And, as an added bonus, I'll even throw\n"
"in a little fishing advice!\p"
"First, you want to face the water,\n"
"then use the ROD.\p"
"Focus your mind…\n"
"If you get a bite, pull on the ROD.\p"
"Sometimes you can snag something\n"
"immediately, but with bigger catches,\l"
"you need to time the pulls on your ROD\l"
"to haul them in.$"
msgstr ""
"另外，我再免费送你\n"
"一点钓鱼的建议吧！\p"
"首先，要面朝水面，\n"
"然后使用钓竿。\p"
"集中精神……\n"
"有鱼上钩的时候，就拉钓竿。\p"
"有时候马上就能钓到东西，\n"
"不过要钓大鱼的话，\l"
"就得看准时机拉钓竿\l"
"才能把它拉上来。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:715
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_ThatsTooBadThen"
msgid ""
"Oh, is that so?\n"
"That's too bad, then.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，是吗？\n"
"那可真遗憾。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:719
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_HowsYourFishing"
msgid ""
"Yo!\n"
"How's your fishing?$"
msgstr ""
"哟！\n"
"钓鱼钓得怎么样？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:723
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_GreatHaulInSomeBigOnes"
msgid ""
"Is that right! That's great!\n"
"Haul in some big ones!$"
msgstr ""
"是吗！太好了！\n"
"多钓几条大的吧！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:727
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_FishingAdvice"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey, don't get down on yourself!\n"
"I'll give you a little fishing advice.\p"
"First, you want to face the water,\n"
"then use the ROD.\p"
"Focus your mind…\n"
"If you get a bite, pull the ROD.\p"
"Sometimes you can snag something\n"
"immediately, but with bigger catches,\l"
"you need to time the pulls on your ROD\l"
"to haul them in.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀，别灰心嘛！\n"
"我给你一点钓鱼的建议吧。\p"
"首先，要面朝水面，\n"
"然后使用钓竿。\p"
"集中精神……\n"
"有鱼上钩的时候，就拉钓竿。\p"
"有时候马上就能钓到东西，\n"
"不过要钓大鱼的话，\l"
"就得看准时机拉钓竿\l"
"才能把它拉上来。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:739
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_XIsTheBiggestHappeningThingRight"
msgid ""
"I like what's hip, happening, and trendy.\n"
"I'm always checking it out.\p"
"Listen, have you heard about this new\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”?\p"
"That's right!\n"
"Of course you know!\p"
"I mean, sheesh,\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”…\l"
"It's the hottest thing in cool!\p"
"Wherever you're from,\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"is the biggest happening thing, right?$"
msgstr ""
"我喜欢时髦、新潮、流行的东西。\n"
"我一直都在关注。\p"
"我问你，你听说过最近的\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”吗？\p"
"没错！\n"
"你当然知道啦！\p"
"我是说，哎呀，\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”……\l"
"可是酷炫界最火的东西！\p"
"不管你是从哪里来的，\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"都是现在最流行的东西，对吧？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:753
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_TellMeWhatsNewAndIn"
msgid ""
"Hunh?\n"
"It's not the hip and happening thing?\p"
"Well, hey, you have to tell me,\n"
"what's new and what's “in”?$"
msgstr ""
"哈？\n"
"这不是现在最流行的东西？\p"
"那你倒是告诉我，\n"
"现在什么才是最新最潮的？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:759
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_OfCourseIKnowAboutThat"
msgid ""
"Hunh?\n"
"“{STR_VAR_2}”?\p"
"… …\p"
"…Uh… Yeah! That's right!\n"
"Yeah, I knew that! Knew it all along!\p"
"Of course I know about that!\n"
"“{STR_VAR_2},” right?\p"
"Yeah, that's it, it's there!\n"
"Isn't “{STR_VAR_2}”\l"
"the coolest, or what?\p"
"It's the hippest thing in hip.\n"
"You think I'd not know about it?\p"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”…\n"
"It's, like, so five minutes ago.\p"
"Now, “{STR_VAR_2}” is\n"
"what's vital and in tune with the times!$"
msgstr ""
"哈？\n"
"“{STR_VAR_2}”？\p"
"…… ……\p"
"……呃……对！没错！\n"
"对，我知道！我早就知道了！\p"
"我当然知道那个啦！\n"
"是“{STR_VAR_2}”对吧？\p"
"对，就是它！\n"
"“{STR_VAR_2}”\l"
"是不是超级酷？\p"
"那可是潮流中的潮流。\n"
"你以为我会不知道吗？\p"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”……\n"
"已经是老掉牙的东西了。\p"
"现在，“{STR_VAR_2}”\n"
"才是紧跟时代的潮流！$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:777
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_XHuhIThinkYIsCool"
msgid ""
"Hmm…\n"
"“{STR_VAR_2},” huh?\p"
"But personally, I think\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"is what's real in cool.$"
msgstr ""
"嗯……\n"
"“{STR_VAR_2}”是吧？\p"
"不过我个人觉得，\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\l"
"才是真正的酷。$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:784
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_HearOfAnyTrendsComeShareWithMe"
msgid ""
"Well, if you hear of any happening new\n"
"trends, come share them with me, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"那么，要是你听说了什么新的潮流，\n"
"记得来告诉我哦，好吗？$"

#: data/maps/DewfordTown/scripts.inc:788
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_YeahDefinitionOfInRightNow"
msgid ""
"Yeah, absolutely right!\p"
"“{STR_VAR_1}” is the\n"
"definition of “in” right now.$"
msgstr ""
"没错，完全正确！\p"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"就是现在最流行的东西！$"
